localdiscord (1.0.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added: WhatsApp-style per-message delete — right-click any message to
    "Delete for me" (local only) or "Delete for everyone" (propagated to peers).
  * Added: Deleted messages show an italic "This message was deleted" placeholder.
  * Added: New "delete" message type in P2P protocol for cross-peer deletion
    with sender validation (only original sender can delete for everyone).

 -- Your Name <you@example.com>  Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

localdiscord (1.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added: Direct Messages — peers auto-appear in DM sidebar on connect,
    single click to open private chat, green/grey online status indicator.
  * Added: File transfer — attach and send files up to 50 MB via encrypted
    TCP connection, received files saved to ~/.localdiscord/files/.
  * Added: Inline image preview in chat for transferred image files.
  * Added: Clickable file links in chat to open with system default app.
  * Added: JSON-based chat history persistence (~/.localdiscord/messages.json),
    messages survive app restarts with UUID-based deduplication.
  * Changed: Chat display upgraded to QTextBrowser for clickable links.

 -- Your Name <you@example.com>  Mon, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

localdiscord (1.0.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added: UDP multicast discovery (239.192.55.1, RFC 2365) for automatic
    cross-subnet peer discovery without configuration.
  * Added: Enhanced broadcast detection — sends to all interface broadcast
    addresses instead of assuming /24 subnet mask.
  * Added: "Add Peer" button in sidebar for manual IP-based connection.
  * Added: Optional relay server (relay_server.py) for networks where
    multicast is blocked.
  * Added: Config options: network.multicast_group, network.multicast_ttl,
    network.relay_host, network.relay_port.
  * Fixed: _broadcast_addr() assumed /24 subnet mask, breaking broadcast
    on non-/24 networks.

 -- Your Name <you@example.com>  Mon, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

localdiscord (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed: initiated P2P connections dropped after ~10s of inactivity because
    the TCP connect timeout was never cleared on the socket.
  * Fixed: TOCTOU race in connection finalisation that caused duplicate
    connections and orphaned sockets when peers discovered each other
    simultaneously.
  * Fixed: responder-side TCP handshake now has a timeout so stalled clients
    cannot block a handler thread forever.

 -- Your Name <you@example.com>  Mon, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

localdiscord (1.0.1) stable; urgency=low

  * Fixed: own messages were rendered twice due to double signal emission.
  * Fixed: incoming messages from peers were rendered twice.
  * Fixed: silent TCP server failure now shows a user-visible error.
  * Added: online users panel now shows each peer's IP address below their name.
  * Added: "Searching for peers..." hint in sidebar when no peers connected.
  * Added: system message includes IP when a peer connects or disconnects.

